<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Biggest gains/falls for ASX 100 index in last year.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Biggest gains/falls for ASX 100 index in last year.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following is a list of the 10 largest gaining and falling stocks for Australian companies included in the Australian Stock Exchange's ASX 100 index for the year to February 7.</p>
<p>Top 10 largest gains in year</p>
<p>Rank Name			  Price     pct change</p>
<p>1   Howard Smith		10.90	     66.16</p>
<p>2   James Hardie		 3.63	     56.47</p>
<p>3   Rothmans		     8.95	     55.65</p>
<p>4   HIH Winterthur	     3.11	     51.87</p>
